{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02666","headline":"登北邙还望京洛 · 郑世翼","name":"登北邙还望京洛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"步登北邙坂，踟蹰聊写望。\n宛洛盛皇居，规模穷大壮。\n三河分设险，两崤资巨防。\n飞观紫烟中，层台碧云上。\n青槐夹驰道，迢迢修且旷。\n左右多第宅，参差居将相。\n清晨谒帝返，车马相追访。\n胥徒各异流，文物纷殊状。\n嚣尘暗天起，箫管从风扬。\n伊余孤且直，生平独沦丧。\n山幽有桂丛，何爲坐惆怅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑世翼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02666.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02666","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}